# TODO context (eh-gallery-queue)

Before implementing features that touch naming, sets, fingerprints, or
gallery organization, **read [`TODO.md`](TODO.md)** at the repo root for open
items and agreed direction.

## Why

Some work is intentionally deferred (e.g. filename → set matching rules the
user will define later). Code already stores soft meta (SHA-1 + name aliases)
so those rules can land without re-downloading.

## Do

- Skim **Open** sections in `TODO.md` when the task overlaps fingerprints,
  aliases, renames, sets, or resize/dHash.
- When closing or starting a deferred item, update its status in `TODO.md`.
- Prefer extending `image_name_aliases` / soft rename over deleting name history.

## Do not

- Invent final set-matching rules without the user when the TODO says they
  will provide them.
- Overwrite or discard alternate filenames for the same SHA-1 — record aliases.
